image::multi-ou-dynamics.png#A two-dimensional path and its component time series reveal temporal memory and correlated geometry.::


classmethods::

method:: ar
argument:: numChannels
Init-rate output dimension, clipped to 1..32; default 2.
argument:: covarianceBuf
Required mono row-major N by N diffusion covariance; default buffer 0.
argument:: meanBuf
Mono N-value mean vector; negative selects zeros (default -1).
argument:: reversionBuf
Mono N-value reversion vector in inverse seconds; negative buffer number selects ones (default -1). Negative entries become zero, the Brownian limit.
argument:: reload
Rising edge snapshots coefficients and refactors Q. Use occasional control-rate edges; no RNG reset.
argument:: seed
Init-rate local PCG32 seed. Zero derives a seed from the parent Synth; nonzero is reproducible. Reset restores the original seed.
argument:: reset
Rising edge outputs loaded means and restores seed; takes priority over reload.
returns:: Exactly numChannels process outputs, in buffer-vector order. Outputs are raw and not normalized.

method:: kr
Control-rate version: one calculation spans the full control block. Event outputs last one block.

instancemethods::

examples::

subsection:: Two related trajectories

The buffer is ready before synthesis starts. This demonstration frees itself after 12 seconds.

code::
(
Routine {
    var covariance = Buffer.loadCollection(s, [1, 0.8, 0.8, 1]);
    var node;
    s.sync;
    node = { MultiOUProcess.kr(2, covariance).poll(5) }.play;
    12.wait;
    node.free;
    s.sync;
    covariance.free;
}.play;
)
::

subsection:: Opposing motion

A negative cross covariance moves the two pitches in opposing directions.

code::
(
Routine {
    var covariance = Buffer.loadCollection(s, [1, -0.8, -0.8, 1]);
    var node;
    s.sync;
    node = { SinOsc.ar(330 * (MultiOUProcess.kr(2, covariance) * 2).midiratio, 0, 0.05) * Line.kr(0, 1, 0.05) }.play;
    15.wait;
    node.free;
    s.sync;
    covariance.free;
}.play;
)
::

subsection:: Ensemble breathing

Four voices share a tendency without becoming identical. The diagonal is stronger than the cross terms.

code::
(
Routine {
    var covariance = Buffer.loadCollection(s, Array.fill(16, { |i| if((i div: 4) == (i % 4), 1, 0.7) }));
    var node;
    s.sync;
    node = {
        var drift = MultiOUProcess.kr(4, covariance, seed: 41);
        Splay.ar(SinOsc.ar([220, 275, 330, 440] * (drift * 1.5).midiratio, 0, 0.04))
            * Line.kr(0, 1, 0.05)
    }.play;
    20.wait;
    node.free;
    s.sync;
    covariance.free;
}.play;
)
::
